B.Lj=new A.b1(B.d_,["Go Amigo","Production App","Your Trusted Ride-Sharing Companion","assets/project-images/go-amigo-2.png",B.IQ,"Go Amigo is a ride-sharing app that connects passengers with professional, friendly drivers for a smooth, safe, and stress-free journey. Whether you are riding or driving, Go Amigo puts comfort, trust, and reliability at the heart of every trip.\n\nFor Drivers\n\u2022 Deliver professional, courteous, and safe rides.\n\u2022 Respect traffic rules and create a welcoming vibe for every passenger.\n\u2022 Enjoy easy ride coordination and fast, secure payments.\n\nFor Passengers\n\u2022 Ride with experienced and dependable drivers.\n\u2022 Follow safety tips, respect your driver, and sit back for a relaxed ride.\n\u2022 Book rides easily with real-time updates on your driver and vehicle.\n\nKey Features\n\u2022 Live Ride Tracking \u2014 stay informed with real-time location tracking.\n\u2022 Cross-Border Travel \u2014 seamlessly travel across Algeria and nearby countries like Tunisia.\n\u2022 Lost & Found Support \u2014 help recovering items left behind.\n\u2022 Secure In-App Payments \u2014 pay easily with a variety of payment options.\n\u2022 Privacy & Safety First \u2014 protected data and safety standards on every trip.\n\nTechnologies: Flutter, Firebase (Authentication, Firestore, Cloud Messaging), Bloc",B.IE],t.yf)
