B.Lk=new A.b1(B.d_,["Avond4daagse Didam","Production App","Your Companion for the Walking Event","assets/project-images/avond4daagse-1.png",B.Iz,"Avond4daagse Didam is the official mobile app for participants, parents, and volunteers, designed to provide real-time updates, schedules, and route information for a smooth and safe walking experience during the four-day event.\n\nFor Participants & Parents\n\u2022 Stay Informed \u2014 receive announcements and updates via push notifications.\n\u2022 View Routes \u2014 access walking routes, start and finish locations, and distances.\n\u2022 Check Schedules \u2014 event timings, start points, and practical information at a glance.\n\nFor Volunteers\n\u2022 Organize Effectively \u2014 track participant information, start points, and routes.\n\u2022 Support Communication \u2014 timely alerts and updates to keep the event running smoothly.\n\nKey Features\n\u2022 Push Notifications \u2014 instant updates about routes, timings, or weather.\n\u2022 Interactive Route Maps \u2014 walking paths with start and end points.\n\u2022 Event Program & Practical Info \u2014 schedules, meeting points, and instructions.\n\u2022 Data Privacy \u2014 no personal data collected or shared with third parties.\n\u2022 Multi-User Accessibility \u2014 built for participants, parents, and volunteers.\n\nTechnologies: Flutter, Firebase Cloud Messaging, Bloc, Clean Architecture",B.IC],t.yf)
