B.Li=new A.b1(B.d_,["Sareean","Production App","Smart Logistics Application","assets/project-images/sareean-1.png",B.Jx,"Sareean is an innovative logistics platform designed to streamline shipment and delivery management. By connecting stores with professional drivers, Sareean ensures efficient, secure, and reliable transportation of goods across destinations.\n\nFor Stores & Businesses\n\u2022 Effortless Shipment Management \u2014 assign and track deliveries in real time.\n\u2022 Reliable Driver Network \u2014 connect with verified drivers for safe, timely deliveries.\n\u2022 Optimized Route Planning \u2014 minimize delays with intelligent routing.\n\nFor Drivers\n\u2022 Earn Flexibly \u2014 accept delivery requests and grow your earnings.\n\u2022 Real-Time Navigation \u2014 precise location tracking for smooth deliveries.\n\u2022 Secure Transactions \u2014 receive payments safely through the app.\n\nKey Features\n\u2022 Real-Time Tracking \u2014 monitor shipments with accurate location updates.\n\u2022 Secure Payments \u2014 seamless transactions with encrypted processing.\n\u2022 Transparent Terms \u2014 clear policies with no hidden charges.\n\u2022 Data Security \u2014 information protected with advanced security measures.\n\u2022 Cross-Border Logistics \u2014 deliveries across multiple regions.",B.j9],t.yf)
B.Iw=s(["assets/project-images/lawyer-lot-1.png"],t.s)
B.Lg=new A.b1(B.d_,["Lawyer Lot","Production App","Your Legal Connection Hub","assets/project-images/lawyer-lot-1.png",B.Iw,"Lawyer Lot is a powerful, easy-to-use platform that bridges the gap between legal professionals and those seeking trusted legal help. Whether you are a client in need of expert advice or a lawyer looking to grow your practice, Lawyer Lot makes it effortless to connect, communicate, and manage appointments in one seamless app.\n\nFor Clients / Users\n\u2022 Find Trusted Lawyers \u2014 search by specialization, location, and ratings.\n\u2022 Book Appointments Easily \u2014 schedule consultations with just a few taps.\n\u2022 Audio & Video Calling \u2014 speak with your lawyer in real time from the app.\n\u2022 Secure & Confidential \u2014 encrypted communication and secure booking.\n\nFor Lawyers\n\u2022 Build Your Legal Profile \u2014 showcase expertise, experience, and availability.\n\u2022 Reach New Clients \u2014 be discoverable by practice area and location.\n\u2022 Manage Appointments \u2014 built-in scheduling and notifications.\n\u2022 Engage in Real-Time \u2014 secure in-app audio/video consultations.\n\nKey Features\n\u2022 Smart Search \u2014 filter by legal category, language, availability, and more.\n\u2022 Real-Time Communication \u2014 high-quality audio/video for instant consultations.\n\u2022 Appointment Scheduler \u2014 integrated booking with reminders for both parties.\n\u2022 End-to-End Privacy \u2014 legal conversations stay confidential and protected.\n\u2022 User-Friendly Interface \u2014 easy to navigate for lawyers and clients.",B.j9],t.yf)
